[
  {
    "en": "“Ah... Good morning.”",
    "ko_bytes": 48
  },
  {
    "en": "“...Hey, you're not in the kitchen?”",
    "ko_bytes": 38
  },
  {
    "en": "“............”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“Did you oversleep? That's not like you.”",
    "ko_bytes": 50
  },
  {
    "en": "“Oh... Good morning, Kasumi.”",
    "ko_bytes": 57
  },
  {
    "en": "“Good morning—”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“Good morning—you're both up early this morning.”",
    "ko_bytes": 70
  },
  {
    "en": "“Heyyy, today's the weekend, I can't wait to try {Me}'s breakfast.”",
    "ko_bytes": 93
  },
  {
    "en": "“My tummy is rumbling.”",
    "ko_bytes": 37
  },
  {
    "en": "“Seems like he overslept today.”",
    "ko_bytes": 61
  },
  {
    "en": "“Yes!”",
    "ko_bytes": 17
  },
  {
    "en": "“Let's all go and wake him up!”",
    "ko_bytes": 37
  },
  {
    "en": "“You look like you want to play some kind of a prank.”",
    "ko_bytes": 62
  },
  {
    "en": "“That's just his morning face.”",
    "ko_bytes": 64
  },
  {
    "en": "“Let's go!”",
    "ko_bytes": 20
  },
  {
    "en": "“Oh—!”",
    "ko_bytes": 13
  },
  {
    "en": "*shhhh* \"Keep it down.\"",
    "ko_bytes": 19
  },
  {
    "en": "“Got it!”",
    "ko_bytes": 19
  },
  {
    "en": "“......”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“What's up, won't it open?”",
    "ko_bytes": 39
  },
  {
    "en": "“Ah... No... I just feel like you're really excited Kasumi?”",
    "ko_bytes": 96
  },
  {
    "en": "“R-Really—”",
    "ko_bytes": 27
  },
  {
    "en": "“Well, erm...”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "*knock* *knock* *knock*",
    "ko_bytes": 15
  },
  {
    "en": "Wait",
    "ko_bytes": 4
  },
  {
    "en": "“We're coming in, {Me}...”",
    "ko_bytes": 41
  },
  {
    "en": "“It's so dark... He's really still asleep.”",
    "ko_bytes": 67
  },
  {
    "en": "“Does something feel a little strange?”",
    "ko_bytes": 57
  },
  {
    "en": "“W-Wait... Let me through.”",
    "ko_bytes": 30
  },
  {
    "en": "“Kasumi?”",
    "ko_bytes": 23
  },
  {
    "en": "“............”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“He's got a fever.”",
    "ko_bytes": 27
  },
  {
    "en": "“Eh?”",
    "ko_bytes": 13
  },
  {
    "en": "“Is he sick?”",
    "ko_bytes": 27
  },
  {
    "en": "“Looks like he's not in a good state...”",
    "ko_bytes": 53
  },
  {
    "en": "“............”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“I'll go and get the thermometer, Shizuku go and get the ibuprofen—”",
    "ko_bytes": 88
  },
  {
    "en": "“Ayano, go and get a towel.”",
    "ko_bytes": 57
  },
  {
    "en": "“O-Okay...!”",
    "ko_bytes": 27
  },
  {
    "en": "Ayano&Shizuku",
    "ko_bytes": 13
  },
  {
    "en": "“38.6 degrees...”",
    "ko_bytes": 19
  },
  {
    "en": "“His color doesn't look good and he's sweating buckets. He must be peaking.”",
    "ko_bytes": 117
  },
  {
    "en": "“What should we do...?”",
    "ko_bytes": 26
  },
  {
    "en": "“Let's do what we can first. Wipe that sweat off him.”",
    "ko_bytes": 96
  },
  {
    "en": "“Okay—”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“Kasumi—”",
    "ko_bytes": 25
  },
  {
    "en": "“All the meds in the house are out of date.”",
    "ko_bytes": 68
  },
  {
    "en": "“Of course... When was the last time we even got new ones?”",
    "ko_bytes": 117
  },
  {
    "en": "“I'll go and get more right away—”",
    "ko_bytes": 40
  },
  {
    "en": "“Let me go, I can run faster.”",
    "ko_bytes": 58
  },
  {
    "en": "“Get some cold desserts or ice cream while you're at it.”",
    "ko_bytes": 69
  },
  {
    "en": "“Yeah, sure.”",
    "ko_bytes": 21
  },
  {
    "en": "“How is he...?”",
    "ko_bytes": 23
  },
  {
    "en": "“Hehe, it's nothing—”",
    "ko_bytes": 37
  },
  {
    "en": "“Leave this to me, you go outside for now, Shizuku. I don't want you to get infected as well.”",
    "ko_bytes": 119
  },
  {
    "en": "“No way.”",
    "ko_bytes": 13
  },
  {
    "en": "“............”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“Muuu...!”",
    "ko_bytes": 22
  },
  {
    "en": "“Okay, then let's both stay with {Me}.”",
    "ko_bytes": 77
  },
  {
    "en": "“Yes.”",
    "ko_bytes": 10
  },
  {
    "en": "“Damn-it... I feel awful.”",
    "ko_bytes": 50
  },
  {
    "en": "“I'm dizzy and hot. My head's spinning. My limbs are weak...”",
    "ko_bytes": 79
  },
  {
    "en": "“I guess I can't work today...”",
    "ko_bytes": 61
  },
  {
    "en": "“I need to get back and sleep, I have to work in the morning...”",
    "ko_bytes": 76
  },
  {
    "en": "“But my home is... so far away...”",
    "ko_bytes": 65
  },
  {
    "en": "“I'm back...”",
    "ko_bytes": 30
  },
  {
    "en": "“.........”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“Mom and dad aren't home...?”",
    "ko_bytes": 56
  },
  {
    "en": "“I should... go to my room.”",
    "ko_bytes": 59
  },
  {
    "en": "“.........”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“Why'd I feel... So unsteady...”",
    "ko_bytes": 51
  },
  {
    "en": "“...Huh, it's morning?”",
    "ko_bytes": 28
  },
  {
    "en": "“Yeah... I'm gonna be late.”",
    "ko_bytes": 37
  },
  {
    "en": "“I need to get going ASAP.”",
    "ko_bytes": 40
  },
  {
    "en": "“But... I can't... move...”",
    "ko_bytes": 59
  },
  {
    "en": "“I can't even lift my legs...”",
    "ko_bytes": 44
  },
  {
    "en": "“—!”",
    "ko_bytes": 10
  },
  {
    "en": "“Hey—get it together, you okay?”",
    "ko_bytes": 37
  },
  {
    "en": "“—Oh... He's burning up!”",
    "ko_bytes": 31
  },
  {
    "en": "“Is he really hot...?”",
    "ko_bytes": 25
  },
  {
    "en": "“I don't know what to do...”",
    "ko_bytes": 45
  },
  {
    "en": "“.........”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "The ceiling... I'm in my room?",
    "ko_bytes": 38
  },
  {
    "en": "Ah... Oh yeah, I started to get a fever last night.",
    "ko_bytes": 72
  },
  {
    "en": "“Umm...”",
    "ko_bytes": 15
  },
  {
    "en": "“Ah... Wait... Don't move!”",
    "ko_bytes": 46
  },
  {
    "en": "“...Shizuko?”",
    "ko_bytes": 27
  },
  {
    "en": "“Hey... Lie down.”",
    "ko_bytes": 42
  },
  {
    "en": "“What time is it?”",
    "ko_bytes": 33
  },
  {
    "en": "“It's 5 o'clock.”",
    "ko_bytes": 17
  },
  {
    "en": "“In the morning?”",
    "ko_bytes": 19
  },
  {
    "en": "“Does it look like morning to you?”",
    "ko_bytes": 43
  },
  {
    "en": "“I guess not.”",
    "ko_bytes": 19
  },
  {
    "en": "“Well, you've still got a sense of humor, that's a good sign.”",
    "ko_bytes": 72
  },
  {
    "en": "“But let's just check your temperature to be safe.”",
    "ko_bytes": 80
  },
  {
    "en": "“.........”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“37.8 degrees... Well, you look better.”",
    "ko_bytes": 51
  },
  {
    "en": "“When was the last time you had a cold?”",
    "ko_bytes": 63
  },
  {
    "en": "“Erm... I don't think I've been sick in a while.”",
    "ko_bytes": 53
  },
  {
    "en": "“And how long exactly is a while...?”",
    "ko_bytes": 56
  },
  {
    "en": "“I guess about 4 years.”",
    "ko_bytes": 36
  },
  {
    "en": "“I heard that if you don't get sick for a while, it can hit you really hard.”",
    "ko_bytes": 107
  },
  {
    "en": "“I think you might be living proof.”",
    "ko_bytes": 57
  },
  {
    "en": "“But, cos' of this, I wanted to talk with you about something.”",
    "ko_bytes": 57
  },
  {
    "en": "“Hmm?”",
    "ko_bytes": 10
  },
  {
    "en": "“I just dreamed of the last time I was sick, 4 years ago.”",
    "ko_bytes": 68
  },
  {
    "en": "“Just like this time, I was in a lot of pain and my head was all muddled but I still tried to put a brave face on it.”",
    "ko_bytes": 114
  },
  {
    "en": "“Before I collapsed, someone came and helped me out, but I don't recall much about them.”",
    "ko_bytes": 128
  },
  {
    "en": "“......”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“When I opened my eyes it was this afternoon and I was in my own room.”",
    "ko_bytes": 77
  },
  {
    "en": "“There were all these medicines and foods at my bedside.”",
    "ko_bytes": 76
  },
  {
    "en": "“I see...”",
    "ko_bytes": 29
  },
  {
    "en": "But it's also a little different from last time.",
    "ko_bytes": 51
  },
  {
    "en": "Those three ladies are all lying beside my bed, snoring peacefully.",
    "ko_bytes": 90
  },
  {
    "en": "They must have been looking after me this whole time.",
    "ko_bytes": 60
  },
  {
    "en": "“Did they eat?”",
    "ko_bytes": 40
  },
  {
    "en": "“After all that, you're still worried about them?”",
    "ko_bytes": 53
  },
  {
    "en": "“That's my job.”",
    "ko_bytes": 32
  },
  {
    "en": "“Ha... Don't tell me you forgot why I'm here?”",
    "ko_bytes": 79
  },
  {
    "en": "“I'm here to help you out. I've been doing everything you couldn't do.”",
    "ko_bytes": 93
  },
  {
    "en": "“But you can't cook.”",
    "ko_bytes": 36
  },
  {
    "en": "“Hey...”",
    "ko_bytes": 12
  },
  {
    "en": "“But I do have a store and I have microwave meals.”",
    "ko_bytes": 90
  },
  {
    "en": "“............”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“Oh... What're you saying, Shizuko?”",
    "ko_bytes": 73
  },
  {
    "en": "“{Me}—?”",
    "ko_bytes": 21
  },
  {
    "en": "“You're finally awake!”",
    "ko_bytes": 32
  },
  {
    "en": "“What is it... Shizuku?”",
    "ko_bytes": 38
  },
  {
    "en": "“Did I fall asleep...?”",
    "ko_bytes": 31
  },
  {
    "en": "“............”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“Ah—！”",
    "ko_bytes": 13
  },
  {
    "en": "“G-Good morning?”",
    "ko_bytes": 25
  },
  {
    "en": "“He's awake. ",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "HideActors",
    "ko_bytes": 10
  },
  {
    "en": "Left",
    "ko_bytes": 4
  },
  {
    "en": "get away from {Me}... Hey!”",
    "ko_bytes": 43
  },
  {
    "en": "“Get—Back—Ah—!”",
    "ko_bytes": 25
  },
  {
    "en": "“Ha... Haaaa... Don't worry about it.”",
    "ko_bytes": 34
  },
  {
    "en": "“How're you feeling? Are you hungry?”",
    "ko_bytes": 48
  },
  {
    "en": "“Can you help me up?”",
    "ko_bytes": 31
  },
  {
    "en": "“Yeah—”",
    "ko_bytes": 12
  },
  {
    "en": "“Thank you. My limbs all hurt a little, but apart from that I feel okay.”",
    "ko_bytes": 88
  },
  {
    "en": "“I'm actually really hungry.”",
    "ko_bytes": 47
  },
  {
    "en": "“Hehe, that's good cos' you haven't eaten all day.”",
    "ko_bytes": 87
  },
  {
    "en": "“Ha... We were so worried. You've been unconscious all day!”",
    "ko_bytes": 98
  },
  {
    "en": "“Yeah, I ran down to the store in tears, I knew something wasn't right.”",
    "ko_bytes": 129
  },
  {
    "en": "“Wh-Who was crying—It was just a bit of dust, that's all!”",
    "ko_bytes": 89
  },
  {
    "en": "“Okay! I've heard that three times today already.”",
    "ko_bytes": 86
  },
  {
    "en": "“Umm...”",
    "ko_bytes": 15
  },
  {
    "en": "“Thank you. Sorry to scare you all.”",
    "ko_bytes": 54
  },
  {
    "en": "“Don't worry about it.”",
    "ko_bytes": 28
  },
  {
    "en": "“Seeing as you're alive, I'll go and make up some porridge.”",
    "ko_bytes": 61
  },
  {
    "en": "“You guys just rest as much as you need. Sick people need to rest if they're going to get better.”",
    "ko_bytes": 71
  },
  {
    "en": "“Alright...”",
    "ko_bytes": 21
  },
  {
    "en": "“Let me help you.”",
    "ko_bytes": 23
  },
  {
    "en": "“Kay.”",
    "ko_bytes": 10
  },
  {
    "en": "“.........”",
    "ko_bytes": 18
  },
  {
    "en": "“{Me}...?”",
    "ko_bytes": 19
  },
  {
    "en": "“What's up... Are you still in pain?”",
    "ko_bytes": 53
  },
  {
    "en": "“No... It's nothing... Just...”",
    "ko_bytes": 36
  },
  {
    "en": "“Getting sick is just such a pain in the ass.”",
    "ko_bytes": 66
  }
]